### ========================================
### 1️⃣ HEALTH CHECK
### ========================================

### Health Check
GET http://localhost:8080/health

### ========================================
### 2️⃣ AUTENTICAÇÃO
### ========================================

### 📝 Registrar novo usuário
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "first_name": "Gustavo",
  "last_name": "Silva",
  "email": "gustavo.teste@example.com",
  "password": "senha123456",
  "phone": "+5511999999999"
}

### 🔐 Login
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "gustavo.teste@example.com",
  "password": "senha123456"
}

### 🔄 Refresh Token
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh_token": "{{token}}"
}

### 🚪 Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 🔑 Mudar senha
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "current_password": "meuteste123",
  "new_password": "maisumavez123"
}

### ========================================
### 3️⃣ USUÁRIO (PERFIL)
### ========================================

### 👤 Ver meu perfil
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ✏️ Atualizar perfil
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Gustavo Silva Rodrigues da Silva",
  "phone": "65993634954"
}

### ⚙️ Ver configurações
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 🔧 Atualizar configurações
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currency": "BRL",
  "language": "pt-BR",
  "timezone": "America/Sao_Paulo",
  "notifications_enabled": true,
  "email_notifications": true
}

### 🗑️ Desativar conta
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ========================================
### 4️⃣ CATEGORIAS
### ========================================

### 📋 Listar todas categorias
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 📝 Criar categoria (Despesa)
POST {{baseUrl}}/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alimentação",
  "type": "expense",
  "icon": "🍔",
  "color": "#FF5733"
}

### 📝 Criar categoria (Receita)
POST {{baseUrl}}/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Salário",
  "type": "income",
  "icon": "💰",
  "color": "#28A745"
}

### 📝 Criar categoria (Transporte)
POST {{baseUrl}}/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Transporte",
  "type": "expense",
  "icon": "🚗",
  "color": "#007BFF"
}

### 👁️ Ver categoria por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ✏️ Atualizar categoria
PUT {{baseUrl}}/categories/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alimentação & Bebidas",
  "icon": "🍽️",
  "color": "#FF6347"
}

### 🗑️ Deletar categoria
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/categories/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ========================================
### 5️⃣ CONTAS BANCÁRIAS
### ========================================

### 🏦 Listar todas contas
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 💰 Saldo total
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/balance
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 📝 Criar conta (Nubank)
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Nubank",
  "type": "checking",
  "balance": 2500.00,
  "currency": "BRL",
  "institution": "Nubank"
}

### 📝 Criar conta (Poupança)
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Poupança Itaú",
  "type": "savings",
  "balance": 5000.00,
  "currency": "BRL",
  "institution": "Itaú"
}

### 📝 Criar conta (Cartão de Crédito)
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Cartão Inter",
  "type": "credit_card",
  "balance": 0,
  "credit_limit": 3000.00,
  "currency": "BRL",
  "institution": "Banco Inter"
}

### 👁️ Ver conta por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ✏️ Atualizar conta
PUT {{baseUrl}}/accounts/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Nubank Pessoal",
  "balance": 3000.00
}

### 🗑️ Deletar conta
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/accounts/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ========================================
### 6️⃣ TRANSAÇÕES
### ========================================

### 💸 Listar todas transações
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 📅 Transações próximas (recorrentes)
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions/upcoming
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 📝 Criar transação (Despesa)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Almoço no restaurante",
  "amount": 45.50,
  "type": "expense",
  "category_id": 1,
  "account_id": 1,
  "date": "2026-02-04",
  "is_recurring": false,
  "status": "paid"
}

### 📝 Criar transação (Receita)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Salário de Janeiro",
  "amount": 5000.00,
  "type": "income",
  "category_id": 2,
  "account_id": 1,
  "date": "2026-02-01",
  "is_recurring": true,
  "recurrence_frequency": "monthly",
  "status": "paid"
}

### 📝 Criar transação (Conta a pagar)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Fatura do cartão",
  "amount": 850.00,
  "type": "expense",
  "category_id": 1,
  "account_id": 1,
  "date": "2026-02-15",
  "due_date": "2026-02-15",
  "is_recurring": true,
  "recurrence_frequency": "monthly",
  "status": "pending"
}

### 👁️ Ver transação por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ✏️ Atualizar transação
PUT {{baseUrl}}/transactions/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Almoço no restaurante japonês",
  "amount": 60.00
}

### ✅ Marcar como paga
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/transactions/3/pay
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 🗑️ Deletar transação
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/transactions/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ========================================
### 7️⃣ ORÇAMENTOS
### ========================================

### 💰 Listar todos orçamentos
GET {{baseUrl}}/budgets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 📊 Resumo dos orçamentos
GET {{baseUrl}}/budgets/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 📝 Criar orçamento
POST {{baseUrl}}/budgets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alimentação Fevereiro 2026",
  "category_id": 1,
  "amount": 800.00,
  "period": "monthly",
  "start_date": "2026-02-01",
  "end_date": "2026-02-28",
  "alert_threshold": 80,
  "alert_enabled": true
}

### 📝 Criar orçamento (Transporte)
POST {{baseUrl}}/budgets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Transporte Fevereiro",
  "category_id": 3,
  "amount": 300.00,
  "period": "monthly",
  "start_date": "2026-02-01",
  "alert_threshold": 90
}

### 👁️ Ver orçamento por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/budgets/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ✏️ Atualizar orçamento
PUT {{baseUrl}}/budgets/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alimentação Fevereiro (Ajustado)",
  "amount": 900.00,
  "alert_threshold": 85
}

### 🗑️ Deletar orçamento
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/budgets/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ========================================
### 8️⃣ METAS FINANCEIRAS
### ========================================

### 🎯 Listar todas metas
GET {{baseUrl}}/goals
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 📊 Resumo das metas
GET {{baseUrl}}/goals/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 📝 Criar meta
POST {{baseUrl}}/goals
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Viagem para Europa",
  "description": "Guardar para viagem de férias em julho",
  "target_amount": 10000.00,
  "current_amount": 0,
  "deadline": "2026-07-01",
  "priority": "high",
  "category": "travel"
}

### 📝 Criar meta (Reserva de Emergência)
POST {{baseUrl}}/goals
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Reserva de Emergência",
  "description": "Guardar 6 meses de salário",
  "target_amount": 30000.00,
  "current_amount": 5000.00,
  "deadline": "2026-12-31",
  "priority": "high",
  "category": "emergency_fund"
}

### 👁️ Ver meta por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/goals/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ✏️ Atualizar meta
PUT {{baseUrl}}/goals/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Viagem para Europa e Ásia",
  "target_amount": 15000.00,
  "deadline": "2026-08-01"
}

### 💰 Adicionar contribuição
POST {{baseUrl}}/goals/1/contributions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 500.00,
  "date": "2026-02-04",
  "notes": "Contribuição mensal de fevereiro"
}

### 📋 Listar contribuições
GET {{baseUrl}}/goals/1/contributions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 🗑️ Deletar meta
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/goals/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ========================================
### 9️⃣ DASHBOARD
### ========================================

### 📊 Resumo geral
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 💵 Fluxo de caixa
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/cash-flow
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 📈 Receitas vs Despesas
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/income-expense
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 📅 Comparação mensal
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/monthly-comparison
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 🏦 Saldos das contas
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/account-balances
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ========================================
### 🔔 NOTIFICAÇÕES
### ========================================

### 📬 Listar todas notificações
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 📭 Notificações não lidas
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications/unread
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 🔢 Quantidade de não lidas
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications/unread/count
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ✅ Marcar como lida
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/notifications/1/read
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ✅ Marcar todas como lidas
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/notifications/read-all
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 🗑️ Deletar notificação
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/notifications/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

